\fs28 \cf2 Purpose of the App (unique, simple advantages)\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 This is an app for coloring and recoloring, not drawing. It only works with vector shapes and solid colors. It supports SVG import and SVG export, but does not support actual drawing or any type of drawing changes except recoloring. It does not support color blends. (Sorry, it would be nice to have some of those features, but with limited resources you can\'92t do everything).\
\
This app makes it easy to see and work with color relationships. That\'92s the purpose of this app, and that\'92s the big advantageous of this app.\
\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

